OL,3,GNEWSAYoung fan's Strictly Come Dancing
OL,4,Adream comes true
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bristol teenager has had a day she
OL,7,Fwill never forget after getting a
OL,8,Fsurprise behind-the-scenes visit to
OL,9,FStrictly Come Dancing.
OL,11,FFliss, 14, who has a serious heart
OL,12,Fcondition, was given a special tour of
OL,13,Fthe BBC primetime TV show, of which she
OL,14,Fis a big fan. It was organised by
OL,15,Fcharity Heart Heroes, which receives
OL,16,Ffunding from BBC Children in Need and
OL,17,Fprovides support to children and their
OL,18,Ffamilies facing the challenges of
OL,19,Fliving with such a condition.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
