OL,3,GNEWSAYoung fan's Strictly Come Dancing
OL,4,Adream comes true
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity organised for the teenager
OL,7,Fto meet the dancers, presenters and
OL,8,Fjudges as well as costume designer
OL,9,FVicky Gill, who made a dress Fliss had
OL,10,Fdesigned.
OL,12,FFliss has spent years watching the show
OL,13,Ffrom home and said: "I loved every bit
OL,14,Fof it."
